;; giemon-factory-r0 — 施工ロボット登録台帳 (construction-robot registry),
;; Datomic-style EDN. SSoT for which robot performs each construction step.
;;
;; The factory is designed to be BUILT by robotics (tatekata 建方 actor,
;; ADR-2605250715). Each construction.edn :step references a :step/robot here;
;; `kami-app-tatekata` simulates that robot performing the step on kami-genesis
;; (reach + cycle), and the geometry "grows" as the robot builds it.
;;
;; :robot/reach-m   manipulator reach (m) — used by the buildability check
;; :robot/base      [length width] of the robot footprint (m)
;; :robot/cycle-min nominal cycle time per unit of work (minutes)
;; :robot/mobile    true = self-relocating base (covers a zone), false = fixed
;; :robot/process   material process it drives: deposition | thermal-weld | none
;; :robot/maturity  HONEST real-world maturity of this robot class today
;;                  field-trial | partial | human-collab  (none is "fully autonomous")

{:robot/meta
 {:robot/of    "giemon-factory-r0"
  :robot/note  "R0 design assignment. Maturity is the HONEST state of each robot class in real construction today — NONE is a turnkey autonomous solution; most are point tools or human-collaborative. Reach/cycle are representative planning figures."}

